Let me look at this from the GNU source code perspective. In `parse_mode.c`:

```c
if (who == 0) /* who was omitted */
  {
    who = WHO_A;
    if (op == '=')
      perm = perm & ~umask;
    else
      perm &= ~umask;
  }
```

